## Comparison of Separator Compatibility

| Separator | Works in Bash? | Works in Dash (/bin/sh)? | Works in Windows (CMD/PS)? |
|---|---|---|---|
| $IFS$9 / ${IFS} | Yes | Yes | No (Linux/Unix only) |
| %09 (Tab) | Yes | Yes | Yes |
| < (Redirection) | Yes | Yes | Yes (CMD only) |
| {cmd,arg} | Yes | No | No |

